\par
\lquote For of those ninety-nine men, not a single one ever returned from the frozen forest of the Hekswood...\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh3194\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
