\pard\intbl There's an old book entitled \lquote The Worst Curse\rquote . Eleven takes it from the shelf and has a closer look...\par
\par
\par
\lquote My story starts innocently enough: I was walking through the forest one day when I came across a leger-de-man. It hadn't seen me, so, overcome with curiosity, I decided to sneak up and take a peek inside its robes.\par
\par
\par
\lquote It noticed immediately, and flew into a rage! \ldblquote How dare you embarrass me like that!\rdblquote , it bellowed. \ldblquote You'll soon see how you like it!\rdblquote  And with that, it stormed off.\par
\par
\par
\lquote Ever since that day, my life has been one embarrassment after another! There's not a doubt in my mind that this is the work of the leger-de-man and the terrible curse it placed upon me.\par
\par
\par
\lquote When I start my prayers at chapel, I suddenly need the lavatory! If I try to talk to a lady, I become so distracted that I forget what to say! And in combat, I am struck dumb with thoughts of previous failures!\par
\par
\par
\lquote Mark my words, dear reader\emdash this is the most embarrassing curse in all Erdrea! I call it Shypox. Alas, even my powers of imagination have been rendered cringe-inducingly weak by it!\par
\par
\par
\lquote And now, even as I write this, I realise my britches have been unfastened this whole time! Truly, this curse is a force to be reckoned with!\rquote\cell\row\trowd\trgaph30\trleft-30\trrh2323\trpaddl30\trpaddr30\trpaddfl3\trpaddfr3
